            "review_title": "Review at Ramen & Butadon OYAMA",
            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nThe only place for Tantanmen Ramen\nJul 2023 • Couples\nIt's hard to find Tantanmen Ramen, but this place has got it. My personal favorite every time. The place is a bit small and can be crowded because it's so popular. Excellent ramen, huge portions and a great meal. Well worth visiting and it's my go to place for a quick (huge lunch).\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 2, 2023",
            "rating": 4.0,
