            "review_title": "Review at Ramen & Butadon OYAMA",
            "review_text": "Mark A\nSitges, Spain8 contributions\n0\nSimply amazed\nMay 2023 • Friends\nAmazed by their taste! I've never encountered this \"genuiness\" in any other city.\nI lived in Hokkaido more than a decade ago, and their flavor reminds me of lots of memories there.\nTried miso ramen and gyoza. Soup is so rich and noodles are as chewy as genuine Hokkaido ramen.\nI'm not sure in Hanoi but we don't see many Hokkaido ramen restaurants in general as the cooking method is complicated compared to other types of ramen.\nHanoians are lucky that they have this place!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 1, 2023",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
